# Class Reunion (battlefield.class_reunion, CloisterOfFrost): the requirement arms of the registrant (BattlefieldQuest's
# check: only the registrant needs the quest state and the item). Main, a level 75 Warrior with the quest accepted and
# the pendulum but ClassReunionProgress 4: the trade to IP_Entrance: no options. bob, ClassReunionProgress 5 and the
# pendulum, the quest only available: no options. cat, accepted and ClassReunionProgress 5 but no pendulum (no trade):
# no options. dan, the quest completed, ClassReunionProgress 5 and the pendulum: a registrant needs accepted: no
# options.
lists CloisterOfFrost/IP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfFrost/IP_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=CloisterOfFrost pos=561.5,-0.8,600.0 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=CloisterOfFrost pos=561.5,-0.8,600.0 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=CloisterOfFrost pos=561.5,-0.8,600.0 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=CloisterOfFrost pos=561.5,-0.8,600.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.ClassReunion accepted
charvar ClassReunionProgress 4
item IcePendulum
bob: charvar ClassReunionProgress 5
bob: item IcePendulum
cat: quest Windurst.ClassReunion accepted
cat: charvar ClassReunionProgress 5
dan: quest Windurst.ClassReunion completed
dan: charvar ClassReunionProgress 5
dan: item IcePendulum
login
trade IP_Entrance IcePendulum x1      # ClassReunionProgress 4: no options
bob: login
bob: trade IP_Entrance IcePendulum x1 # available: no options
cat: login
cat: trigger IP_Entrance               # no pendulum traded: no options
dan: login
dan: trade IP_Entrance IcePendulum x1 # completed: no options
